  "sale_events": [],
  "body": "This exquisite character apartment, built in the Art Deco style, captures timeless sophistication in an unbeatable location on Devonport’s main street in the original Post Office building. Overlooking the village, the home blends classic design with contemporary comfort. \r\n\r\nA generous, sunny home, it features elegant Art Deco detailing throughout, a large bespoke kitchen and a generous open-plan dining, family space plus a stunning lounge with a gas fire. The kitchen and family room open to a beautifully private enclosed courtyard garden with a large outdoor fireplace and a BBQ perfect for entertaining year-round.\r\n\r\nOne wing has three double bedrooms plus a family bathroom, and the separate master suite has a walk-in wardrobe, tiled ensuite, and opens to a private courtyard - ideal for a relaxed morning coffee. A versatile additional room provides space for a workroom, media room or office.\r\n\r\nComplete with a lift, intercom and heating year-round plus a double tandem garage and two further carparks, this property provides total comfort, peace of mind and is ideal as an easy-care family home or lock-up-and-leave base. Living in the heart of the village is wonderfully convenient, with Devonport’s charming shops, cafés and restaurants on your doorstep and the ferry to the city just moments away. Enjoy the best of village living close to the beach in this truly special home. \r\n\r\nPhone for appointment to view.",
